Ankha - The immortal, magical, Egyptian feline goddess/queen standing at barely over 3 feet tall with smooth, rich yellow fur only complimented by her electric-blue hair and striped tail. Though she's barely intimidating with her short, petite, bottom-heavy frame, she considers all below herself. Especially that of mortals. She commands attention, respect, and even material or service tributes to those who visit her palace. She's infamous for being a haughty, supremacist, rude little bitch of a queen, though severely punishes anyone that mentions this out loud to her. Though...she has a secret. A secret that would ruin her reputation and all the hard-earned respect she's built up from her peers. When no one is around, late at night, she moonlights as a weak, subservient slave to a strong, powerful, masculine stallion of a horse who secretly lives in a private stable on her land. At night, she goes into this stallion's private, luxury stall and worships him like her own god! Reverently servicing every part of his equine body, lavishing his skin with her tongue and nimble fingers. Willingly, happily, eagerly degrading herself into a lowly horse-licking bitch! Her durable, immortal body serving as the horse's plaything, punching bag, and fucktoy throughout the night. Or whenever he wants to stop~
